From 7d2d1388440f2565120d1493c3233e476bc45fca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivory <contact@ivory.cafe>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 07:26:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 14/21] Preserve protected logical DEX evidence for UI recovery

Constraint: Protected DexFile ranges may be split and non-contiguous
Rejected: Direct DataBegin/DataSize memcpy | caused SIGSEGV on protected com.VCB data
Confidence: medium
Scope-risk: moderate
Directive: Keep host promotion gated by runtime table provenance, object identity, and reachability validation
Tested: m com.android.art -j8; ART source tests; 19 host Python tests; device smoke after deployment
Not-tested: A fresh targeted run with all UI CodeItem artifacts retained
Change-Id: I5935004b9408ae2a00a698c91bc0061103b63894
